{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Crosshair is a multi-module crosshair overlay application for Windows. It allows you to use any image as a crosshair with various customization and share options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udfaf FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Omnivorousness</strong>: Use any image as a crosshair\u00a0\u2013 it supports both static <i>BMP</i>, <i>JPEG</i>, <i>PNG</i> and animated <i>GIF</i> formats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aiming accuracy</strong>: The center of the image is always in the center of your screen, even on a massive 8K setup</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full DPI awareness</strong>:\u00a0Scale your crosshair from a pixel to the image size retaining its quality at any resolution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Compatibility</strong>: Support for Windowed and Fullscreen Windowed display modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Image Editor</strong>:\u00a0Turn any\u00a0<i>BMP</i>, <i>HEIC</i>, <i>JPEG</i>, <i>PNG</i>, or <i>WEBP</i> images into your brand-new, fine-tuned crosshairs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Workshop Integration</strong>: Publish your animated or static crosshairs in just a few clicks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udfc5 USAGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of a monolithic structure, My Crosshair organizes\u00a0each feature into its own dedicated module:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upload Crosshair</strong>: Workshop uploader for My Crosshair</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Edit Image</strong>: Image Editor tool for your crosshair images</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>User Manual</strong>: Access the user manual for My Crosshair</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Workshop</strong>: Explore My Beautiful Crosshair Hub</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with My Crosshair</strong>: Play games with your crosshairs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Browse Downloads</strong>: Access all the crosshairs you have subscribed for</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isolation ensures that resource-intensive tasks run independently. This guarantees that your in-game overlay remains responsive and lag-free at all times.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3830340?t=1767602708","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830340/f88bc1e08ca6e8386088ab64ceed1b135ee3f148/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767602708","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830340/00bc290622a809ed78224c6dfd72175b2e61497e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767602708","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830340/00bc290622a809ed78224c6dfd72175b2e61497e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767602708","categories":[{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Crosshair is a multi-module crosshair overlay application for Windows. It allows you to use any image as a crosshair with various customization and share options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udfaf FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Omnivorousness</